<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Ekajuk New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Hibru</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hibru</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hib</para>
  <para style="mt2">NWER NYI BO NYONO TV</para>
  <para style="mt1">ANEBE HIBRU</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s">Mmon no Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Mahne mahne Esowo jo bungu tong babnso ejahre go ajoobo abang nkpel tvv, sehng go anyo nya abanyehnamahr.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 11:13; Luk 1:70</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />Esꞌkohro ngare nyia á bungu a nahre sehng goji Mmon ewe,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 4:4</char></note> ye ji á yehk-e no re á bahke lehke elkv nsol kpee. Ye wo á ko-e no lim njini. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Á kpꞌyake tib ellub ni Esowo. Á li na li ful ful fuul ana yefono Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 12:45</char></note> Alum enye nya kpi nsahm nyi kpꞌwahnge nsol kpee kpꞌjene go nseenge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 1:17</char></note> Eji á ma ru ane, bo ma bar go bo abiafem, owo á kehm song ji go eboblum Esowo bi gbale sehng, bi li go ero.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mmon Esowo wo ga gbal sehnge babenjel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Anv, Mmon Esowo ebfere gbal sehnge babenjel, eji á ma bel mbing nyi nobo sehnge nyi bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 4:12</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Esowo ka tong a tong enjel anyehng anyehng re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Wo mmon ewame wo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 1:11</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">lela wo, m ma jol Nso.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 1:5">Jol á ka tong a tong enjel anyehng anyehng re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“M bahke jolo Nso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">a bahke jolo mmon ewame.”<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Eji Esowo yahke ba ngbokambang a mmon ewe tum tv go njini, á kpe bung re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">“Nong, babenjel nya Esowo kpee kak-e.”<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Esowo bungu bade babenjel re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">“Esowo kpo lim enjel enye, bo jol nfeb,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 7:1</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">fere jo lim alokeltum ebe, bo jol nlikagun,”<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />fere bung bada Mmon ewe re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">“Eti etul eja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">o Esowo, li go njinanjini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">Á kpo fili ejahbetul eja go etingitingi.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Etingitingi ji kpo kor-a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">ebi jo sab-a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">Owo wahnge, wo Esowo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">Esowo eba ma-a kak akehng go esi, mao ma eyebatahng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">eji a lꞌgbal sehnge abonane.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Esowo kpe bung re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">“Wo Ntul, wo wo limi njini go mbomannahb.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">Elbung ni li ejum ji a limi go ega abo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 1:3</char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Nyaa kpee bahke male, wofono antahng wo bahke sake.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 24:35; Jon 1:1</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:11">Nyaa kpee bahke kulu ana mbomo.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />A bahke fehde elbung abola ndi ana ekpawobo, bahke fere yaange.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 6:14; 21:1</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">A bahke jolo ano ano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">a nehm tiki kul.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Esowo tikem tong enjel anyehng anyehng re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">“Ji go egame ejang eboblum</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">tete me n lim anebekv eba etikunakpade eja.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 20:41-44</char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Anv, ane aba li babenjel? Bo kpee atohko nya kpo loko eltum nya, nya Esowo kpo tum bo re bo song kak ane ebo, ba bahke bele eltahre.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 5:19; 11:13-14; 27:23-24</char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s">Egburu eltahre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Ano wo wahnge nobo re wahr jo sahb kꞌkunu ekpu go nsol nyi e ma wuk, eji e lꞌkꞌfab tahm.<verse eid="HEB 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Eji etib bi babenjel jo tiingi yiimi no, nne awohng awohng no lꞌsoodo, afi á bumem alum nyao, á jo nyehne erem ana fuumu no re á nyehn,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 10:28</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />anv, e bahke limi renan kehm beke for, e lꞌgbake egburu eltahre ana nia bum go nkpe, ni Ntul ewahre gbo mbang tiingi?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 12:47-48</char></note> Ane ba wuk-e no, ba ma tob ba tong-r re li go etingitingi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 1:2</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Esowo tob yiimi ntianse, eji á jo tib nliingi nyi nsahm enye, fere lim ajoobo akpokosi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 10:25</char></note> fere bak ane ayare nya Etingi Etohko ana kor-e no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 12:8-11</char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ane ba ga gbal sehnge babenjel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Tibre Esowo faakem a njini nyi kpꞌbake nyi e kpꞌbungu bade kak babenjel go elwo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pit 3:13</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Edi nwer Esowo ajehng bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">“Nne awo li li nne no Esowo bahk-e jo tiiri?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">Nne awo li li Mmon no nne no a bahk-e jo kunu ekpu?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 1:24</char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />A lim-e á jol rede rede sehnge babenjel mmongare ntiil,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:7">a fere ka-e ellub, a ekpunu ji li ka ntul.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 2:9-11</char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />Wobbum ejum ajehng ajehng re á kunu akpade.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Ana Esowo ma yake ejum ajehng ajehng kak-e go elwo, ejumjum limm, ji á tahme sa, ji ki-e wob go elwo. Anv, e kpꞌnyehne re, ngare ka rehng nyi nsol kpee bahk-e woomo go elwo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tes 2:1-3</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />E kpꞌnyehne Jisos ji Esowo lim-e, á jol rede rede sehnge babenjel go mmongare ntiil, eji á lꞌkpo go esi ane kpee, tib go nnoobo nyi Esowo. Anv, Esowo m-e ka ellub, a ekpunu ji li ka ntul tib go erem bi á nyehne no, fere kpo.<verse eid="HEB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Fꞌfuumu re Esowo rod erem bi Jisos nyehne no, lim-e á jol go nseenga nseenge, ye ji wahnge nsol kpee li no, ye jꞌnehm wo Esowo ko-e, lim nsol kpee, eji á lꞌko abon gbalee tahm a bo go ege ellub. Tibre Jisos wo wahnge re bo bel eltahre. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Ye ji kpo lim ane, bo jol ebo ebo, a ane ba á ma lim bo, bo ma jol ebo ebo, bo kpi nde na awohng. Owo wahnge á kil kpe nyaare bo, á kpꞌfere jo lung bo re abonanyehn,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 20:17</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />ana á bungu no re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">“M bahke bungu bada mbing enya tong abonanee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">M bahk-a tehke go elkab aneb Esowo kpee.”<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Á kpe bung re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">“M bahke bumu Esowo go etingitingi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 27:43</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">Á kpe tob bung re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">“Nyehn me ga, a abon ebame ba Esowo ma-m ka.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Tib eji abon bao kpi ngubjing, a alung, Jisos kehm tob ba jol ana bo, fere bel ngubjing, ba rannge nnehm nyi elkv wob-e go elwo, tib go ege elkv,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 12:31</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />fere tahre ane kpee yake, ba jolo aju ngare nyi bo jolo go elkpin tib go elfahle ni bo jo fahl elkv.<verse eid="HEB 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Tibre etingitingi, á kpehme kak babenjel ebo. Abon ba Ebraham ba, á kpo kak bo ebo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 3:29</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Ano wo wahnge Esowo limi Jisos re á jol ana abonanyehn go mbang anyehng anyehng, eji á lꞌjol nkakesehk a ntubesi abalimajom no kpi ndon go elloko ni á kpꞌloko Esowo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 2:10; 4:15</char></note> fere gongo Esowo tib abiafem nya ane. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Tib eji yefono antahng jo nyehn erem, bo fere gar-e, anv á bahke ma kak ane ebo, ba lꞌyel go elgaare.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s">Jisos wo ga gbal sehnge Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Abarebare abonanee ba Esowo ma-n tob lung, jo seengen Jisos ji li ntiingetib, a ntubesi abalimajom no e kpo yiimi ntianse ka-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 12:2; 4:14</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Á bele ekakesehk, taame tv nne no yehk-e no kak go eltum ene, jang jang ana Moses bele ekakesehk go eltum kpee ni á jo lim go etahk Esowo. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Jisos wo fuumu re á ga bel ellub sehnge Moses, jang jang ana nne no si etahk ga kpi ellub sehnge etahk ji á si no. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Tibre etahk ajehng ajehng nne wo sii. Wo, Esowo bi li nne no limi nsol kpee.<verse eid="HEB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Moses bele ekakesehk go eltum kpee ni á jo lim go etahk Esowo, ye ji jolo nlokeltum, eji á lꞌyiimi ntianse ka nsol nyi Esowo bahke bungu go ngare esꞌsong. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Wo, Kraist bele ekakesehk go eltum ni á limi go ege etahk, ye ji jolo mmon. Etahk eje jio, wahr ba,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 2:5</char></note> e lꞌyiimi tꞌtahne go esahb, a elgeere ni e kpꞌgeere kak nsol nyi e kpꞌkunu ekpu tete rehng go esꞌkohro.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jo kunen ekpu, eji ń lꞌkꞌ yake Esowo abo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Ana Etingi Etohko bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">“Ń lꞌwuk alum enye lela,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />kana tahne asi enyahne ana babnso ejahne limi no</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">efung elgaare bio bi bo ten-m no go elka emahng.<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Go wo bo wuung-m no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:9">jol eji bo nyehne nyehn nsol nyi n limi go nnya atahl abal.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Ano wo wahng ka atahng rak-m no tob ane bao,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">n kehm bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">‘Bo kpo kono elsoodo go bo a ntir atahng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">Bo ka tiki kahn mbang enyame.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Owo n kehm tiri go egame erakatahng re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:11">‘bo nehm tiki yel go egame edi erekekv.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 10:5-11</char></note><verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Abonanee, jo kunen ekpu, eji nne awohng awohng ewahne lꞌkꞌbel ebi eltim ni á kil taame, toono o, á sennge Esowo bi kpi elkpin njahm. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Jo rehken atemtem efung abehng abehng,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 5:11</char></note> eji ngare kpeke li nyi bo kpo lung re, “lela”, eji nne awohng awohng ewahne lꞌkꞌtahne esi tib go elnehme ni abiafem kpo nehm ane. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Wahr ebjol ane ba kpꞌkodo eljen a Kraist, e lꞌjabb-e tꞌtahne, fere bum-e go etingitingi tete rehng go esꞌkohro, ana e bomo go mbomo, <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />ana nwer Esowo bungu no re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">“Ń lꞌwuk alum enye lela, kana tahne asi enyahne,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 24:25</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">ana babnso ejahne tene Esowo mahne.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Anv, elkohn ane aba wuku alum Esowo, fere ten? Ane kpee ba Moses yehke bo go Ijib sanga?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 7:21</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Anv, ane aba Esowo rake atahng tob bo go nnya atahl abal? Ane ba limi abiafem, fere kpo go elka emahng sanga? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Anv, ane aba Esowo tiri re, bo nehm tiki yel go ege edi erekekv? Ane ba ki taame sanga?<verse eid="HEB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Wahr ebnyehn re, bo maam yel tib go bo ekꞌtaame.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="s">Edi erekekv ji Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Enyam bi Esowo nyame no re e bahke yele go ege edi erekekv bia, kpeke li. Nong, wahr jo fahlen, eji Esowo lꞌkꞌtong nne awohng awohng ewahne re, yebsa go njahm. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Tibre wahr ebwuk nnoobo etib, jang jang ana bo. Etib bi bo wuku no kaam bo nnoobo anyehng anyehng, tibre bo ji wuku no joom taame. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Wo, wahr jia ji ma taame, wahr ba kpꞌyele edi erekekv jio. Ana Esowo bungu no re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">“Me n tir go egame erakatahng re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">bo nehm tiki yel edi erekekv ejame.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 3:11</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Eji Esowo limi njini, ngare nyi eltum ene ma mal, <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />á kehm bungu bade efung bi biingi nfung esehma re, “Efung bi biingi nfung esehma, bi bi n re ekv go egame eltum kpee.”<verse eid="HEB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Edi nwer Esowo jehko, á kpe bung re, “Bo nehm tiki yel edi erekekv ejame.”<verse eid="HEB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Ane ba gbo mbang wuk nnoobo etib yelem, tib eji bo ki taame. Egom jehko jia, ji bahke yele ona.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 11:28</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Tibre Esowo ebkpe kunu afung nya á jo lung re, “lela”. Eji ma kang ekidi ma lab, á bungu alum nya e ma tohko bung a, sehng go nnyo mi Devid re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">“Ń lꞌwuk alum enye lela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">kana tahne asi enyahne.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Li re Josua kꞌka bo erekekv jio, kehn eji ma kang, Esowo jolem kpe bung bade efung bindiki. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Fvfo, erekekv jia, nong kpꞌsiki aneb Esowo, ana Esowo re ekv efung bi biingi nfung esehma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tes 1:7</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Tibre nne awohng awohng no lꞌyel edi erekekv ji Esowo, á kpꞌtob re ekv go ege eltum, ana Esowo re ekv go ege eltum.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 14:13</char></note><verse eid="HEB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Nong, wahr noken, eji e lꞌyel edi erekekv jio, nne awohng awohng kꞌgbo ana ane bao gbo no tib go bo ekꞌtaame.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 10:5</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Tibre alum Esowo kpi elkpin, kpꞌlimi eltum. Kpꞌkongo sehnge ekahngkahng abehng abehng bi kpo kong njahm ebal ebal. Kpo jahm nne, yel rꞌrehng atahng edi ji eltim, a etohko song wane, a adi nya akahb song kono, nya nya li nlꞌlame no kpo lam ntir atahng a nne, fere jo lam nsol nyi nne ko tir re á lim. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Ejumjum limm ji li go mbiiri, ji á kil elnyehne. Nsol kpee li gbuul go ege esamahr.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 3:19-21</char></note> Ye wo li nne no bahk-r bahbe.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisos wo li ntubesi abalimajom no nnen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Eji e kpi ntubesi abalimajom no nnen, no sehnge elbung sa rehng go ejahbetul Esowo, ye ji li Jisos Mmon Esowo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 8:1</char></note> nong, wahr jabbe nsol nyi e kpꞌtaame tv tꞌtahne. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Tibre ntubesi abalimajom ewahre li nne no bo m-e wuungu go mbang anyehng anyehng ana wahr. Owo wahnge á kpꞌkahne re, wahr nehme tahne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 2:17</char></note> Jol eji bo wuung-e wuungu o, abiafem á limem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 7:26; Jon 8:46</char></note><verse eid="HEB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Nong, wahr belen esahb, jeere kohlo eti etul ji Esowo bi kpi nnoobo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 5:1-2</char></note> Owo e bahke nyehne ndon nyi Esowo, fere bel nnoobo enye nyi bahke jo kak-r ebo ngare nyi e lꞌseb ekakebo.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="s">Jisos li nlimanjom ana Melkisedek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Ntubesi abalimajom awohng awohng no bo yehk-e go ellong ane kpo loko Esowo go esi ji ane. Á kpo ko ayare song ka Esowo, fere lim ajom nya abiafem. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Á kpo guubu ane ba kil elkahne, a bao ba kpo soodo, eji yefono antahng ki tob li go nseenge. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Owo fvfo á bahke jo lim njom nyi abiafem enye, fere tob jo lim nyi ane bako. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Nnene limm, no kpo yehke elne go ege a ngang antahng, fere lim lub ane re, ye li ntubesi abalimajom, sehngem re no, Esowo bi lung-e, jang jang ana á lungu Eron. <verse eid="HEB 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Ano wo fvfo Kraist ki mehl elne wahre re á jol ntubesi abalimajom.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 7:28; 12:49</char></note> Esowo bi yehk-e no, bi bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">“Wo wo li mmon ewame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">lela wo m ma jol nso.”<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Á kpe bung edi jehko re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">“A bahke jolo nlimanjom go njinanjini</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">ana Melkisedek jolo no.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Ngare nyi Jisos jolo go elkpin go njini nyia, á jo kake ero, fere jo gboongo Esowo, jo rabe eling wahre wahre wahre, jo yehke abonngo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 22:41-44</char></note> Á jo kake ero ka nne no bahk-e ma tahre yehke go elkv. Owo wahnge Esowo jo wuk-e, tib go elfahle ni á jo fahl-e. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Jol eji á jolo jol Mmon no Esowo, á jo kpili ana á bahke jo wuk Nde tib go erem bi á jo nyehn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 2:8</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Eji á ma mal go nseenga nseenge, owo á kehm fere jol ana esi ebgba bi eltahre ni li go njinanjini kpo lohng ka ane ba kp-e wuku,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 5:32</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />ye ji Esowo m-e lung re á jol ntubesi abalimajom ana Melkisedek jolo no.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erehke ji li bade ane ba kil elkahne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Nsol nyia tvv, nyi e bahke bungu bade eyaame jia, nyi kpꞌriidi go ellennge, eji ḿ ma jol alakatung ane.<verse eid="HEB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Ngare nyia a, kehn wahn ebtiki jol atꞌtibi, wo anv, ń kpꞌkpeke sebe nne no bahk-n tibi agbokombang nsol nya alum Esowo. Ń kpi nnyabe nnyabe abel, kehn nyi ḿ ma kehme nsol alehke nyi kpꞌtahne li.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 3:1-2</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Nne awohng awohng no kpꞌyabe abel, á kpeke li mmon elbili, á nehme kahn alum Esowo antahng, nya kpo tib nne ana á bahke lehke eno go esamahr bi Esowo. Á kpo lim aji aji.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 4:14</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Nsol alehke nyi kpꞌtahne li ka ane ba ma gbal, ba ma kpili, ma kpuuru bo, bo ji ma kahn go bo a ntim ji kpꞌnobo, fere kahn ji kpꞌsabe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 1:10</char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="s">Erehke ji li bade elgboko lohng go abo nya Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Fvfo, nobo re wahr yake agbokombang nsol nya Kraist go eltibi, fere soro asi, eji e lꞌgbal, kꞌkpe sa go nnahb ekahme, kꞌkpe jo tib bade ana nne bahke sennge njahm go nsol nyi ki lohng ejumjum,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 2:16</char></note> fere taame tv Esowo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 2:8</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />kꞌkpe jo tib bade awohngalahb,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 6:3-8</char></note> a abo akunu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 13:3</char></note> a elnyahme go elkv, a elam ji Esowo bahke lame abi ane, bo nyehn erem go njinanjini.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 5:28-29</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Ano wo e bahke limi, Esowo lꞌtaame.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Anv, ane ba wuku wuku jolo go ellennge ni Esowo, ba ma gbo, lohng go abo nya Esowo, bo bahke limi renan, kehm feere, kpe ba gbo ndon? Bobwuungu ayare nya lohngo go ejahbetul, fere bel etohko ji Esowo, a aneb Esowo. <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />Bobwuungu nnoobo nyi alum Esowo kpi no, a nsahm nyi Esowo bahke tibi go eying ji kpꞌbake. <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />Lꞌfere jol ano, bo kehm gboko, lohng go abo nya Esowo, bo nehm kpe ma feere, ba gbo ndon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 12:16-17</char></note> Tibre bofono antahng kpꞌkumu Mmon Esowo go ekros, fere rik-e ndon go elkab ane.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Esowo kpo fuulu ndi nyi kpo wo elahb ji kpo na nkpel tvv, nyi kpo lim nsol gbal, fere jo kak ane ebo, nyi wahnge bo ja edi ndi jio. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Akpiri lꞌfere mahng edi ndi jio, a agasame, lohngo re, edi ndi jio nobem. Ebsa ntiil Esowo su edi ndi jio, esꞌkohro, á gohro jahm fi.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Akpondahme enyame, jol afi e bungu ana, e kpꞌsahb kꞌkahn re, wahn ba kpi nsol nyi ga nob, nyi li ka eltahre enahne. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Esowo li etingi nne. Á nehm yini eltum enahne ni ń kpꞌlimi, a elkoro ni ń tibi no, ni mbing enye kp-n koro, eji ń jo loko aneb Esowo, jol anv, ń kpi nlimi nlimi ano. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Jo sahb kor-r kor re, nne awohng awohng ewahne soro asi ano, jo nok go eltimtim anehng, eji ń lꞌbel ekunukpu ji ń lꞌkꞌtiki faabe tete rehng esꞌkohro. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Kana jo gbo ewon! Jo leemen eljini ni ane ba taame no, fere jo kpuumu, ni wahnge bo bele nsol nyi Esowo nyame tong bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 5:10-11</char></note><verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Enyam bi Esowo lohko li go etingitingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Eji Esowo nyame enyam tong Ebraham, eji á ki bel nne no gbale sehng-e, no kehn á jol-e tiri, á kehm tiri elne re, <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />“Etingitingi, m bahk-a fuulu, fere lim etꞌtohngo eja rur.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Owo Ebraham kehm kpooro, kehm lohko bel ji Esowo nyame no tong-e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 4:17-25</char></note><verse eid="HEB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Nne lꞌkehm tiri, á kpo tir nne no gbale sehng-e. Nne lꞌtir ano, lohngo re, nfaabe kpee ebmal, ellum ene bahke lohko yiimi. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Ano wo Esowo tob tir budu go ege enyam bi á nyame no, eji á sebe re á tib ane ba á nyame tong bo go mbang nyi bo lꞌkꞌkpe ma faabe re, á nehm yaange ji á toobo no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 1:17</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Eji Esowo kil jo kim efahnge, owo wahnge á ka-r nsol ebal nyio nyi lꞌkꞌtiki yaange, nyi li egburu ekakeltim ejahre, wahr jia ji ma be, song yel eju go ege, fere tub ekunukpu ejahm, ji e ma yehke kunu go nsol nyi kpꞌbake go esꞌsong.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 15:19; 1 Jon 3:2</char></note><verse eid="HEB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Ekunukpu jia li ana eronron nlehke mi ma jabbe atohko enyahre, eji lꞌkꞌfab tahm, mi bo kahne go njahm ekpiki nyehko edi ji sahb bꞌbar,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 8:2; 9:3,7</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />edi jꞌnehm o ji Jisos gbo mbang yel tib go egahre esi, ye ji ma jol ntubesi abalimajom go njinanjini ana Melkisedek jolo no.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s">Melkisedek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Melkisedek jia jolo ntul no Salem, fere jol nlimajom no Esowo bi gbale sehng. Eji Ebraham jo kehnge ebta bi á song nok a atul bao, sehnge bo, Melkisedek kehm song kpir-e, fere fuul-e. <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />Ebraham kehm-e kake eltahme go nsol kpee.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 7:2">Go ngbokambang, Melkisedek lohngo re, “Ntul no li go etingitingi.” Á tob jolo “ntul no Salem” ji lohngo re, “ntul no elkoono.” <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Á belem nde, a nnyehn. Jol nwer nyi etꞌtohngo eje limm. Jol e wukem bade ana bo jel-e no. Jol ana á kpo no, e wukem. Ye wo foongo Mmon no Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 8:58</char></note> Á bahke jolo nlimanjom ano ano go njinanjini.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Nyehnen ana á jolo njꞌjoka nne. Ebraham nso ejahre ka-e eltahme go nsol nyi á ko go ebta.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 3:1-2; Mak 5:22</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Abone Livai ba jolo abalimajom, Esowo tongo bo re, bo jo ko eltahme ana atahm nya Moses bungu no goji abonanyehn, jol eji abonanyehn bao tob lohng go etꞌtohngo ji Ebraham. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Melkisedek lohngem go etꞌtohngo ji Livai. Wo, á kꞌko eltahme goji Ebraham, fere fuul-e, Ebraham ji Esowo nyame enyam tong-e re á bahk-e fuulu. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Nne no kpo fuulu wo ga gbal sehnge nne no á fuul-e no, jol nfaabe anyehng anyehng limm.<verse eid="HEB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Bade eyaame ji abalimajom, bo ji bahke kpoko na, bo ba li ane ba kpo ko eltahme. Wo, eyaame ji Melkisedek ji ko eltahme, ye wo nwer Esowo yiim-e ntianse re, á li go elkpin.<verse eid="HEB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Jol nne li ma bung re, yefono Livai ji jo ko eltahme, tob ka eltahme ngare nyio nyi Ebraham ka Melkisedek eltahme. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Tibre ngare nyi Melkisedek song kpiri Ebraham, Ebraham ka gare ana á bahke jele Livai.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Atahm nya abone Israel ko no tokko go eltum ni abalimajom. Li re eltum ni abalimajom bao ba lohng go etꞌtohngo ji Livai jolo go nseenga nseenge, kehn jolem kpe jol re nlimanjom noko kpe lohng ba ana Melkisedek.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 3:20; Gal 3:19</char></note> Nlimanjom noo limm ana Eron jolo no.<verse eid="HEB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Wo, lꞌfere jol re, eltum ni abalimajom ebyaange, atahm bahke tob yaange fvfo. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Tibre Jisos ji bo bungu nsol nyia bada ne lohng go etꞌtohngo jindiki ji nne awohng awohng kala jꞌjol nlimanjom. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Nne awohng awohng kpꞌkahne re, Jisos Ntul ewahre lohng go etꞌtohngo ji Juda, ji Moses ki gahm egahmegahme eji á jo bung bade abalimajom.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 1:2</char></note><verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nlimanjom no nfenfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Jia ebkpe sahb lꞌlennge na budu, eji nlimanjom nondiki ma lohng ba ana Melkisedek, <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />no ki jol nlimanjom tib go eyaame ji etꞌtohngo ana atahm bungu no. Á jolo nlimanjom go nsahm nyio nyi elkpin ni li go njinanjini. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Tibre nwer Esowo yiimi ntianse ka-e re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">“A li nlimanjom go njinanjini</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">ana Melkisedek.”<verse eid="HEB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Akꞌkulu atahm bobgbake bum go nkpe, tibre nsahm kpimm, ejumjum lohngem. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Atahm nya Moses maam lim ejum ajehng ajehng jol go nseenga nseenge. Anv, wahr ebbel ekunukpu ji ga nob, ji kpo wahng e jeere kohlo Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 13:38</char></note><verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Esowo tirem, eji á limi abon Livai, bo jol abalimajom, wo, go eyaame ji Jisos, Esowo tꞌtir. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Eji Esowo tiri no, á kehm-e tongo re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Jehova ebtir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">á nehm yaange ntir atahng enye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">‘A li nlimanjom go njinanjini.’ ”<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Owo wahnge Jisos ma fere jol nne no ma wahng egbanngalung ji ga nob ma yiimi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 22:20</char></note><verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Abalimajom bako jolo go egom, tibre bo jo kpꞌkpo. Bo joom kpe ma soro asi go bo eltum.<verse eid="HEB 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Wo, Jisos li go elkpin ni li go njinanjini. Eltum ene ni njom alimi, nnene limm, no bahke koko nji enye. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Owo wahnge ngare anyehng anyehng á kpo mal jo tahre ane ba kpo sehng go ege, rehng goji Esowo, tibre á li go njinanjini re á jo gboongo Esowo ka bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 8:34; 1 Jon 2:1</char></note><verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Elkohn nlimanjom noo wo fuumu a nahre, ye ji li saang, egahme á kpimm, elem ajehng ajehng we limm. Á jolem nne abiafem, á jolo eje eje. Bo rod-e bum wahre wahre sehng ejahbetul Esowo sa. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Á limm ana abalimajom bako. Limm re á jo lim ajom efung abehng abehng, tohko jo gbo mbang lim njom nyio nyi abiafem enye, fere tob lim nyi abiafem nya ane bako.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 5:1-3</char></note> Á limi njom nkpelkpel anyehng eji á yake elne ka.<verse eid="HEB 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Atahm nya Moses yehke ane ba ki li go nseenge re bo jol atubesi abalimajom. Wo, alum nya Esowo tiri no,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 6:17</char></note> ngare nyi Moses ma tohko ka atahm, nya nya yehke Mmon no bo m-e lim á ma jol go nseenga nseenge, fere jol go njinanjini.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s">Egbanngalung ji nfenfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />A wo li ejum ji wahnge e kpo bꞌbung. Nyehnen elkohn nlimanjom no e kpi no, ye ji jehk go ejang eboblum bi eti etul ji Esowo bi nnen a nnen go ejahbetul Esowo. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Á kpꞌloko go edi ji sahb bꞌbar, ji li go etingitingi ebkpatahk Esowo ana ntubesi abalimajom, ebkpatahk bio bi Jehova si antahng, bi ki li nne si no. <figure style="fig" alt="The house of God" file="hk00245c.tif" size="col" loc="Heb.8:2" ref="8:2">Ebkpatahk bi Esowo</figure><verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Nlimajom awohng awohng bo yehk-e na re á jo ko ayare song ka Esowo, fere jo lim ajom. Owo fvfo nlimanjom ewahre bahke tob bel ejum ji á bahk-e kake.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 9:12</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Li re á li go njini, kehn á jolem jolo nlimanjom ejolojolo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 7:14</char></note> eji abalimajom li na, ba kpꞌkoko ayare song ka Esowo ana atahm bungu no. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Ebkpatahk bi bo kpꞌlimi eltum li ana ntugare, fere li go elfoongo ni ebkpatahk bi li go ejahbetul Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 2:16-17</char></note> Ngare nyi Moses yahke si ebkpatahk bio, owo Esowo kehm-e tubu elle re, “Kunu ekpu, eji a lꞌlohko lim ejum ajehng ajehng jang jang ana n tib-a no go ewong.”<verse eid="HEB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Anv, Kraist ebbel eltum njom alimi ni ga nob. Fvfo, egbanngalung ji ye li nkonambum, ji ji ga nob, tibre egbanngalung jia kun go enyam bi Esowo nyame no, bi ga nob.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 6:17</char></note><verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Li re ngbokambang egbanngalung jolo go nseenga nseenge, kehn Esowo jolem kpe seb re á kpe lim etoono jehko.<verse eid="HEB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Tibre Jehova nyehne re, ane ebe limm go nseenge, owo wahnge á kehm bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">“Afung kpꞌbake nya m bahke tuungu lim egbanngalung ji nfenfe a abone Israel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">a etꞌtohngo ji Juda.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Nehm jol ana egbanngalung ji n limi a babnde ebo efung bio bi n jabbe bo go ebo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">yehke bo go ndi nyi Ijib. Eji bo tene egbanngalung ji n limi a bo, owo wahnge n ki kpe jo kpur bo. Alum nyaa Jehova wo bungu.”<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Jehova kehm kpe bung re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">“Egbanngalung ji a, ji m bahke limi a abone Israel afung nyao lꞌsehng. M bahke kake atahm enyame go bo a ntir atahng, fere nyon go bo a ntim. M bahke jolo Esowo ebo, bo bahke jolo ane ebame.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 10:16-17</char></note><verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Nnene limm, no bahke jo tib nne ebjing ewe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">fere jo tong mmonannyehn re, ‘Kahn Jehova!’ Tibre bo ane kpee bahk-m kahne, bomo abonse tete ba rehng ajꞌjok ane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 2:20,27</char></note><verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Tibre bo bahk-m fili ndon tib go bo a nsoodo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:12">N nehm kpe tiki buumu abiafem ebo.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Eji Esowo jo bung bade egbanngalung ji nfenfe, eblohng re, yebrod ngbokambang egbanngalung bum ana nkꞌkulu ejum.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 3:11,13</char></note> Ejum ji ma kehme elkulu, ngare nyi ma gohro kul, bahke gulu eltane.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s">Ana bo jo loko Esowo mahne mahne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Go ngbokambang egbanngalung, atahm jꞌjol nya jo tib ana bo bahke jo kak Esowo. Edi tob jolo o, ji bo jo kak Esowo, ji ane limi no. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Tibre bo si ebkpatahk. Go ngbokambang ekpꞌkpa wo, bo bumu enyaale, a ekpꞌkuru, go abred nya bo jo lim bum go esamahr Esowo. Edi jio, bo jo lungu re mbarebare edi. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Edi ji jolo go njahm etoono ekpiki jehko,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 27:51</char></note> bo jo lungu re edi ji kpꞌsahb bꞌbar. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Owo ekpingi ji bo limi go agul jolo no, ji bo jo kak insens, a elkohl ni egbanngalung, ni bo nyane agul wohng bulu kpee. Ekpingi agul ji mmanna woomo go atahng, woomo atahng elkohl nio, a ebti bi Eron bi kake anyane, a atal abal nya Esowo nyono atahm nya egbanngalung.<verse eid="HEB 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Enjel na ebal nyi jo tib ellub ni Esowo kuumu go mbulu elkohl, nyi Esowo jo tahm ka ane go bo abiafem. Bo nyange akpungkpung ebo bulu edi jio ji eltahmeka. Anv, e nehm ma ji, tooro ejum ajehng ajehng kpee. <verse eid="HEB 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Ana wo bo jo toobo ejum ajehng ajehng bum. Ngare anyehng anyehng abalimajom jo yele ekpꞌkpa re bo song lim eltum ebo. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Ntubesi abalimajom wo wo jo yel nkimi nyi sahb bꞌbar nkpel anyehng go elya. Á joom tiki yel, kꞌfili alung njom ma abiafem enye, a nya ane.<verse eid="HEB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Nsol nyia, Etingi Etohko kp-r tibi re, mbang ka lennge nyi nne bahke sehnge rehng nkimi nyi sahb bꞌbar,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 10:19-20</char></note> eji ekpꞌkpa kpeke li, <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />ji kpꞌtibi bade eying jia ji anv, ji ane kpo ka ayare, fere jo lim ajom ka Esowo nya lꞌkꞌma lim nne no kpꞌlimi ano eltim ene jol saang go esamahr bi Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 15:3; 1 Jon 1:7</char></note><verse eid="HEB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Elloko ni bo jo loko Esowo go nsol alehke, a nsol elwoko, a ajoobo abang nya bo jo ru elbo, nya nya li atahm nya li ka ngubjing. Esowo ka bo atahm nyaa re bo jo bum tete ngare rehng nyi á bahke tuungu nsol kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 4:1-4</char></note><verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alung ma Jisos ma kpo ru eltim nne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Anv, Kraist ebba ana ntubesi abalimajom no anoobo nsol nya kpꞌbake. Ebkpatahk bi á kpo lim eltum bi bi ga gbal, fere nꞌnob. Tibre ane sang si go ebo. Limm ka njini nyia. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Kraist yele edi ji sahb bꞌbar nkpelkpel anyehng, fere sa o.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 7:27</char></note> Eji á yele no, á koom alung ebul, a alung abon efong. Á ko alung mame yefono antahng, yel a ma, fere fak-r yake go njinanjini. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Alung ebul, a alung efong, a atong mmon a nfong no bo m-e jahm fi, bo jo ko madde ane ba ki li saang, bo fere jol saang go bo a ngubjing. <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />Lꞌjol ano, anv, alung ma Kraist sang bahke ga ru ntir atahng enyahra, eji e lꞌyake nsol nyi ki lohng ejumjum, fere jo loko Esowo bi li go elkpina?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 1:18-19</char></note> Tibre á yake elne ka Esowo ana ejum njom ji ki kpi elem ajehng ajehng, tib go nsahm nyi etohko ji li go njinanjini.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Esi jia ji wahnge Kraist li nkonambum no egbanngalung ji nfenfe,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 2:5</char></note> eji ane ba Esowo ma lung bo lꞌbel ejum elehke elkv ji li go njinanjini, ji Esowo nyame no. Tibre elkv jꞌjol ni fake ane yake go abiafem nya bo jo lim ngare nyio nyi ngbokambang egbanngalung.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Nne lꞌnyon nwer ngare nyi á yahke ba elkpoko kak go elkohl, lohngo re nne noo bahke tohko kpo, ejum ajehng ajehng kehm jolo. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Tibre nwer nyi á nyono kak go elkohl lohngem ejumjum, eji á kpeke li go elkpin. Ngare nyi á ma kpo, owo bahke kehm jolo ana á nyono no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 7:2-4</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Ki li re alung ma, kehn ngbokambang egbanngalung jolem yiimi. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Tibre, eji Moses bungu ellum anehng anehng ni atahm tong ane, owo á kehm koko alung ma abon efong, a ma ebul, jo ko alahb, a abilibili av, a isob, madde go nwer atahm nyio, fere madde ane kpee, <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />kehm bungu re, “A wo li alung ma egbanngalung ji Esowo tong-n re wahn jo bum atahm enye.”<verse eid="HEB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Mbang nyꞌnehm nyi Moses tob madde alung go ebkpatahk, a nsol kpee nyi bo jo ko loko Esowo. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Etingitingi, ka riki ejum ajehng ajehng bo jo ko alung, lim bar. Ki li re alung ma, kehn eltahmeka go abiafem limm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 1:7</char></note><verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kraist kpo nkpelkpel anyehng tib abiafem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Nsol nyia nyi li go elfoongo ni nsol nyi li go ejahbetul Esowo tikem bar,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 8:5</char></note> sehngem re no, bo limi re bar go mbang nyia. Wo, atingitingi nsol nya ejahbetul Esowo kpꞌsebe ajom nya ga nob sehnge ajom nyako.<verse eid="HEB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Tibre Kraist yelem go mbarebare ebkpatahk bi ane si go ebo, bi li go elfoongo ni etingitingi ebkpatahk. Á yele go yefono ejahbetul Esowo re á song yiimi go esamahr bi Esowo, fere jo gboong-e ka-r.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 2:1</char></note><verse eid="HEB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Ntubesi abalimajom no Jus jo yele edi ji sahb bꞌbar a alung ma ki li mame nkpel anyehng go elya anehng anehng. Wo, Kraist yakem elne ka nkpel a nkpele. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Jolo jol ano, kehn á jol nyehne erem nkpel a nkpele bomo go ngare nyi Esowo limi njini nyia. Wo, ano limm. Nkpel anyehng nyi á lohngo no ba esꞌkohro ngare nyia a,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 10:11</char></note> eji á lꞌtane abiafem tib go njom nyi á limi no ngare nyi á yake elne ka.<verse eid="HEB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Ana nne awohng awohng bahke kpoko nkpelkpel anyehng, kehm song yiimi go eti elam ji Esowo, <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />ano wo fvfo Esowo ma rod Kraist ka ana ejum njom nkpelkpel anyehng, eji á lꞌsol abiafem nya ane gbalee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 10:45</char></note> Á bahke kpe ba, ba tahre ane ba jehk kp-e siki.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 14:3</char></note> Á nehme kpe ba tib go abiafem.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="s">Atahm li go elfoongo ni atingitingi nsol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Atahm nya Moses li go elfoongo ni anoobo nsol nya kpꞌbake, yefono nsol nyio sang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 7:19; 8:5</char></note> Ajom nyanehm nya Jus kpo lim elya elya. Owo wahnge atahm lꞌkꞌma lim ane ba kpo jeere kohlo Esowo, bo jol go nseenga nseenge go ege esamahr. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Jolo jol ano, kehn bo jol rahke ajom alimi. Li re ane ba jo kak Esowo bꞌbar, go bo abiafem nkpelkpel anyehng, kehn Esowo nehme kpe buumu bo abiafem ebo.<verse eid="HEB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Wo, ajom nyao nya kpo buumu bo abiafem ebo elya elya. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Tibre alung efong, a ma ebul nehm ma tiki ru eltim abiafem. <verse eid="HEB 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Owo wahnge ngare nyi Kraist yahke ba go njini, á tongo Esowo re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">“A kpehme seb ajom, a ayare.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">A toobo ngubjing bum-m.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 8:3</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Ajom nya bo kpo jahm nsol fi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:6">a ajom nya bo kpo lim, eji abiafem lꞌlaade bo, wa kpehme kor.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 9:13</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Owo n kehm bungu re, ‘Nyehn me gana, o Esowo, me m ba re me m ba lim ji kp-a koro, ana bo nyono bada name go nwer Esowo.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 6:38</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Á tohko bung re, “A joom seb ajom, a ayare, a ajom nya bo kpo jahm nsol fi, a ajom nya bo kpo lim, eji abiafem lꞌlaade bo. Nsol nyia wa joom kor.” Á bungu ano, jol eji bo jo lꞌlim ajom nyao ona ana atahm bungu no. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Owo á kehm kpe bung re, “Anv, me m ba re me m ba lim ana ji kor-a no.” Jia lohngo re, Esowo ebrange agbokombang ajom fere bum nyi Kraist.<verse eid="HEB 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Tib eji Jisos Kraist limi ji koro Esowo, owo wahnge e ma bar go egahre abiafem kpee tib go njom nyi á yake ngubjing enye ka nkpelkpel anyehng. <verse eid="HEB 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Nlimajom awohng awohng kpo yiimi, jo lim eltum ene efung abehng abehng, jo lim ajom nyanehm nkpel tvv, nya lꞌkꞌma ru eltim abiafem. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Wo eji Kraist ma lim njom anyehng nyi li ano ano go njinanjini tib esi abiafem, owo á kehm jehke go ejang eboblum bi Esowo, <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />kpꞌsiki tete Esowo lim anebekv ebe, bo jol etikunakpade eje. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Tibre go njom nyio na anyehng nyi á limi no, nyi nyi á ma lim ane re bo jol go nseenga nseenge, fere jol ano go njinanjini, bo ji ma bar go bo abiafem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 5:18-20</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Etingi Etohko kp-r tob yiimi ntianse. Tibre á gbo mbang bung re,<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />“A wo li egbanngalung ji m bahke limi a bo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Afung nyao lꞌsehng, owo m bahke kake bo atahm enyame go bo a ntim, fere nyon go bo a ntir atahng. Ana wo Jehova bungu no.”<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Owo á kehm kpe bung re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:17">“N nehm kpe tiki buumu abiafem ebo ebuumubuumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:17">a abi nsol nya bo jo lim.”<verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Eji ane ma si bꞌbel eltahmeka go nsol nyio, njom anyehng anyehng kpeem li, nyi bo bahke kpe lim tib esi abiafem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 8:10-13</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eltaame, a ekunukpu, go elkoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Owo fvfo abonanee, e kpi esahb ji e bahke ma yel ebkpatahk bio bi Esowo, sehng song yel edi ji sahb bꞌbar tib alung ma Jisos. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />Á lennge mbang nyi nfenfe go ekpiki ka-r, nyi li mbang nyi elkpin. Ekpiki jio, ngubjing enye nyi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 27:51; Hib 9:24</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Ana e kpi egburu nlimanjom no kpꞌfili etahk Esowo, <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />nong, wahr jeeren kohlo Esowo a eltim anehng, a eltaame ni e kpꞌbumu Esowo go etingitingi, a agubjing enyahre nya bo ma-r wohngo alahb ma kpꞌwili, a ntim nyi kil jo ka-r ebi, tib eji bo ma-r ru go alung ma Kraist.<verse eid="HEB 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Nong, wahr yiimi tꞌtahne go ntianse ayiimi ka ekunukpu ejahre, kꞌgbiingi elnahre. Tibre ye ji ma nyam tong-r, fuumu re wahr bum-e go etingitingi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 4:20</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Nong, wahr jo tiren ana e bahke jo melle atemtem, eji e lꞌjo tib elkoro, fere jo lim nnoobo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 9:2</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Nong, wahr kꞌjo yaange akon enyahre,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 18:20</char></note> ana egom jindiki kpo kono ellimi, wahr jo kaken na atemtem ntim, gohro tꞌtong ngare nyia nyi ń kpꞌnyehne re, efung bio bi Ntul kpꞌkabbe abake.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erehke ji li bade elam ji kpꞌbake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Eji e ma bel elkahne ni etingitingi jio, fere kpꞌlimi abiafem go elrang, njom anyehng anyehng nyi bahke ruku ntim enyahre, laade abiafem nyao kpeem li.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 6:4-6</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Ji ma sa li re, elfahle ni e jehk a ni kpꞌsiki elam, a amennge agun nya bahke fehke anebekv ba Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pit 2:4</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌgbo ntahm nyi Moses, bo bahk-e wulu, eji ane abal, ane ara ma yiimi ntianse. Jol ndon anyehng anyehng bo nehm be. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Anv, ń kpꞌtiri renan? Elkohn erem abi bahke fuumu a nne no lꞌkadde Mmon no Esowo go akpade, fere rod alung ma egbanngalung ji Esowo bum daange daange daange, ma m-e lim, á ma bar, fere su etohko jio ji nnoobo nyi Esowo?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 3:29; Jon 16:9</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Tibre e kpꞌkahne nne no bungu re, “Me wo li mbꞌbongo. Me wo li ntꞌtuuru.” Á kpe bung re, “Jehova bahke lame ane ebe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 4:17-18</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Li emennge ejum sehng re nne gbo yel go abo nya Esowo bi li go elkpin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 12:29</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erehke ji li bade ana nne Esowo bahke jo kpuumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Buumen ana ń jolo wuku wuku, eji ḿ bele ellennge ni Esowo, ana ń jolo go etahntahn ngare, jo kpuumu erem. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Nkpel nyindiki bo jo su-n go elkab ane, fere jo nohk-n. Wahn ebjol ana ane bako ba kpꞌtob nyehn erem ano.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tes 2:14; 2 Tes 1:4</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Tibre aneb agbekobo jo fil-n ndon. Jol eji bo taar-n taare nsol enyahne go eko, ń yake na go eyebatahng ka go, eji ń kpꞌkahne re, wahnfono antahng kpi nsol nyi ga nob, nyi bahke jolo go njinanjini.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 6:20; Luk 12:13-15</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Kana yake Esowo abumu go etingitingi! Tibre bahke kake nne egburu eltuuru. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Nobo re wahn jo kpuumu, eji ń lꞌmal lim mbang nyi Esowo, fere bel ji á nyame no. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Ana nwer Esowo bungu no re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">“Bahke kpe kang ntiil, nne no kpꞌbake kehm bake.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">Á nehm laange.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pit 3:9</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Edi nwer Esowo jehko kpe bung re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:38">“Etingitingi nne bahke bele elkpin tib go ege eltaame.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 1:17; Ef 2:8</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:38">Wo, á lꞌjeere, feere njahm, eltim m-e nehm kpe yebe tob-e.”<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Tibre wahr limm ane ba kpo feere njahm, fere rannge. Wahr ane ba ma taame, fere bel eltahre ba.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s">Bade eltaame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Eltaame li elkahne ni nne ma sahb kꞌkahn re, á bahke bele nsol nyi á kpꞌkunu ekpu, fere kahn re, nsol nyimongo nyi á kil ma nyehn lohko li go etingitingi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 5:7</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Eltaame ni wahnge Esowo jo fa ane ba mahne mahne nnyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 4:3</char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Eltaame ni wahnge e kpo kahn re, Esowo tohko bung ellum ene, nsol kpee kehm jolo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pit 3:5</char></note> Lohngo re, Esowo ko ji nne kil nyehne, lim nsol nyi nne kpꞌnyehne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 4:18</char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebel, Enohk, Noa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Eltaame ni wahnge Ebel limi njom ka Esowo nyi ga nob sehnge nyi Ken. Eltaame ene ni wahnge Esowo fa-e nnyo re á lohko jol etingitingi nne, eji á ko njom nyꞌnye. Eltaame ni á taame tv Esowo ni wahnge á kpi mbungu mbungu a nahre, jol eji á ma kpꞌkpo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 23:35; Hib 12:24</char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Eltaame ni wahnge Enohk ki kpo. Esowo rod-e tahm a ne go ero. Bo we kpeem tiki nyehn, tibre Esowo rod-e rod tahm a ne. Nwer Esowo bungu re, “Re Esowo kehm rodo Enohk tahm a ne, Enohk jo limi ji jo kor Esowo.” <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Tohko tiki jol eltaame, nnene limm, no bahke ma lim ji bahke jo kor Esowo. Tibre nne awohng awohng no lꞌseb re á jeere kohlo Esowo, á bahke taame re, Esowo bia, lohko li, á kpo tuuru ane bao ba kp-e sebe.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Eltaame ni wahnge Noa wuku erehke ji Esowo kak-e bada nsol nyi kpꞌbake, nyi á ki nyehn go amahr. Eji Noa ma wuk erehke jio, á kehm kehme elfahle. Owo wahnge á kono egbang bi bahke tahre ane ebe. Eji á ma lim ano, á ka njini ebi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 12:41-42</char></note> ye li eno ji Esowo, ji nne bahke lehke, á lꞌtaame.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 24:37-39; 2 Pit 2:5</char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebraham, Aisik, Jekob, a Josef</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Eltaame ni wahnge Ebraham wuku Esowo, eji á tong-e re, á lohng song go edi ndi ji á bahk-e kake ana ejum elehke elkv. Á kehm lohngo go ege ejahbe asongo. Á joom kahn edi ji á fi fi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 4:20; Jon 21:18</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Eltaame ni wahnge á song lene go edi ndi ji Esowo nyame no tong-e re á bahke bele. Ebraham, bo lene o ana ajahmjahm, jo kang go nkpatahk, a Aisik, go Jekob, bo ji Esowo nyame tong bo re, bo bahke lehke elkv nꞌnehm ni Ebraham. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Tibre Ebraham jo siki ejahbe ji Esowo toobo no, fere lim, ji kpi nnahb ekahme.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 21:2</char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Eltaame ni wahnge Sera bele nsahm nyi á sa ela, jol eji á kulu kul sehnge ngare nyi, kehn á jol jele. Tibre á bumu nne no nyame no tong-e go etingitingi. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Fvfo, go etꞌtohngo ji Ebraham ji tob jol nne no ma kul sehng go mmon ajele wo, ane gbalee lohngo no, ba ruru ana alonlo, a erikehndi bi li go aya, bi nne lꞌkꞌma fange.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Ane bao kpee kpꞌkpo a eltaame eltaame ebo. Bo belem ji Esowo nyame tong bo. Bo jo nyehne na fee,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 5:7; Rom 4:19-22</char></note> fere jo kak Esowo nnyo go ejum jio, fere jo taame re, bo ajenne nya, a ajahmjahm go njini nyia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 17:14-16</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Ane ba kpo bung ana, bo kpꞌtibi re, bo kpꞌlohko seb ejahbe. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Li re Bab Ebraham jo tiiri bade ejahbe ji bo lohng no, kehn bo jol ma feere. Tibre eyake jꞌjol ji elfeere. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Bo kpꞌsebe na ejahbe ji ga nob, ji li go ero. Fvfo, Esowo nehme nyaare bo. Yebtaame re, bo lung-e re Esowo ebo. Tibre yebtoobo ejahbe bum bo.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Eltaame ni wahnge Ebraham yake mmon ewe ka ana ejum njom, ngare nyi Esowo wuung-e no. Á toobo ebjing re á yake mmon ewe na awohng awꞌwohng ka, <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />no Esowo nyame enyam tong-e bada ne re, “Ane ba bahke lohngo go ega etꞌtohngo bahke lohngo go eyake ji Aisik.” <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Ebraham bumu re, Esowo bahke ma nyahme ane go elkv. Owo wahnge Esowo kehm feere a ne ka-e ana ejum ntugare.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 4:17</char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Eltaame ni wahnge Aisik tongo Jekob abola Eso re, bo bahke bele elfuulu go ngare esꞌsong. <verse eid="HEB 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Eltaame ni wahnge Jekob biri elfuulu ni Esowo tv abone Josef na abal ngare nyi á yahke ba elkpoko. Á gongo feere go ege esi ebtifilibo, fere tonngo o, kak Esowo.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Eltaame ni wahnge Josef bungu ngare nyi á yahke ba elkpoko bade ana abone Israel bahke lohngo go Ijib, fere tong bo ana ji bo bahke limi a ekv eje.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moses, a Josua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Eltaame ni wahnge, nde, a nnyehn Moses behre Moses go nnyahng era, ngare nyi bo jel-e na jel. Tibre bo nyehne re á jolo mmon no nobo sꞌsehng. Bo fahlem ntahm nyi ntul jehke no.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Eltaame ni wahnge, eji Moses gbale no, á tene re, bo kꞌjo lung-e re, mmon no mmon a Fero. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Á yehke ejang bi aneb Esowo, fere jo nyehn erem a bo. Á sebem re á jo li ebno bi abiafem bi li mmongare ntiil. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Á rodo erem esono bio bi Kraist bi á nyehne no bum ana afang nya ga gbal sehnge nya Ijib, tibre á yehke ekunukpu eje kpee kunu go eltuuru.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 19:27-28</char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Eltaame ni wahnge Moses lohngo go Ijib tahm. Á fahlem erakatahng ji ntul. Á jo kpuumu, jol are á nyehne na Esowo bi nne kil ma nyehn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 7:55</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Eltaame ni wahnge á limi elkak Pasova, fere madde alung, eji nne no kpꞌbake re á ba wul agbokombang abon lꞌkꞌlak bo ebo.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Eltaame ni wahnge abone Israel sehnge go Abilaya, ano are bo jene na go emahng. Eji anebe Ijib gare re bo tob lim ano, bo kehm tane go alahb.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 12:48</char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Eltaame ni wahnge ekahme ji Jeriko gbo no, eji abone Israel jene sennge nfung esehma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 17:6</char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Eltaame ni wahnge Rehab nnenkal asꞌsa ki tob kpo a ane bako ba ki taame tv Esowo, tibre á vvrv ane ba weele ba nyehn ejahbe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 2:25</char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ane bako ba tob taame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Anv, jen ji m bahke kpe bung budu? Ngare m-e limm, nyi m bahke kpe bung bada Gideon, Barahk, Samson, Jefta, Devid, Samuel, a abanyehnamahr, <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />ba eltaame wahnge no, bo jo nok nta, ga ajahbe nyako. Bo jo limi ji li go etingitingi, fere bel ji Esowo nyame tong bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 2:25-30</char></note> Bo ba gbaange anyo nya agabe. <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />Bo ba lahme agun nya jo nyare. Bo ba be for go elkv ni bo jol wulu bo go ekahngkahng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 7:29</char></note> Bo ba bele nsahm go elleenge ni bo ma leenge,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 11:30; 12:5,10</char></note> fere tahne go ebta anoko, jo ga nsoja nyi ajahbe nyako, fere jo kam bo. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Anebkal, akvne ebo jo kpe nyahme, ba tob bo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Wo, ane bandiki jo nyehne erem bi ebnohko, fere ten re, bo kꞌyehke bo yake, eji bo lꞌnyahme go elkv efung bindiki, ba bel elkpin ni ga nob. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Ane bandiki jo nyehne erem bi bo jo nyok bo, fere jo dv bo. Bandiki, bo jo gba bo alehke, fere bum bo agbekobo. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Bandiki, bo jo tuubu bo atal. Bandiki, bo jo ko ntahme amahn, jo kiimi bo ekpidi ebbal. Bandiki, bo jo wulu bo go ekahngkahng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 7:52</char></note> Bo jo kake agunyam ejoro, a nya ebul, jo yannge. Bo gbo ekpak, fere woomo go efemfem, bo fere jo nohk bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 1:6</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Njini nyia fuumem a bo, tibre bikem a bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 11:11</char></note> Bo jo yannge go elka emahng, a awong, fere jo kang go akpatal, a abing nya li go ndi.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Ane bao kpee lohngo elgahm ni nno tib go bo eltaame, jol eji bo ki bꞌbel ji Esowo nyame tong bo. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Tibre Esowo ebtoobo ejum ji ga nob bum-r. Bo nehm waka jol go nseenga nseenge, eji e kala jol a bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 6:9-11</char></note><verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s">Esowo kpo kak ane ba kpo kor-e erem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Fvfo, eji e kpi egburu ellong atianse ana nia ni yim senng-r kak, nong, wahr tob radden elsol anehng anehng fvfo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 11:28</char></note> fere laade abiafem nya ma-r sahb lꞌlaake.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 7:21</char></note> Nong, wahr been abahl go ekakesehk,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 9:24-27</char></note> nya Esowo ma toobo bum-r, <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />jo soro na asi, jo seenge Jisos, ye ji ekakesehk ejahre tohk-e no, bomo go mbomannahb tete rehng go esꞌkohro, ye ji erem esono bi bo son-e no ki-e tohko lꞌlub, á fere kpuumu erem bi ekros tib go eyebatahng ji noongo, jo sik-e, kehm song ji go eboblum eti etul ji Esowo.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Jo buumen ye ji ma kpuumu erem bi aneb abiafem jo ko-e ekv, eji lꞌki-n jo kpen, ń fere jo yini ekpu. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Go ebta bi ń kpꞌnoko a abiafem,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 5:17</char></note> ń ka nok tete rehng go elkv. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Anv, wahn ebyini erehke ji Esowo kak-n no, eji ń li abon ebea? Á bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">“Mmon ewame, ka jo daange erem bi Esowo lꞌkak-a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">Nong, eko ki-a jo tan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">Esowo lꞌnyam-a.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 16:23</char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Tibre Esowo kpo kak nne no kpo kor-e erem.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:6">Á kpo dv mmon awohng awohng no á lꞌko-e.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 3:19</char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Jo kpuumen erem bi Esowo kp-n kake. Tibre á kp-n fili ana abon. Anv, mmon awo no nde kil jo kak-e erem? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Esowo tohk-n kak erem ana á kake abon bako, jia lohngo re, wahn abon nnahb sang, wahn aju nya.<verse eid="HEB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Wahr fvfo, e tob bele babnde baka baka ba njini, ba jo kak-r erem, e jo kake bo. Anv, nde no atohko sang e bahk-e ga woomo go elwoa, fere bel elkpina? <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Babnso ejahre kak-r erem mmongare ntiil, ana koro bo. Wo, Esowo kpo lim ano, eji lꞌnob a nahre, e fere jol ejahre ejahre ana ye li no.<verse eid="HEB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Ngare erem anyehng anyehng limm nyi nne kpo bel eyebatahng, ngare nyi nne bahke jehke ndon ndon nyi. Wo, lꞌkang go, ane ba ma kpili, ma kpuuru bo, bahke kabe nkab elkoono nyi li eno ji bo bahke lehke go esamahr bi Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 4:17-18</char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erehke ji li bade Eso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Kungen abo enyahne nya ma-n kpeere, wahn tob kungu alahng enyahne nya ma lahng. <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />Limen mbang nyi toro tor, wahn jo jen, eji ekpade ji ma lohng lꞌkꞌdemme, lꞌfere nob.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 12:20</char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Jo noken, eji ń lꞌjo bel elkoono a nne awohng awohng,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 12:18</char></note> wahn fere jol ejahne ejahne. Nne awohng awohng no tohko jol ano, á nehm nyehn Jehova. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Jo kunen ekpu, eji nne awohng awohng lꞌkꞌsa nnoobo nyi Esowo, eji nlohk eti nyi kpꞌlulu lꞌkꞌyel go ege eltim, fere jo ko ntong ba, toono o, lim ane gbalee jol eltehb eltehb.<verse eid="HEB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Jo kunen ekpu, eji nne awohng awohng lꞌkꞌbel ebi elkpin, fere jol nne no Esowo kil jo lub-e ana Eso ji gungu nsol elehke elkv enye go ntahma nsol alehke na anyehng. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Ń kpꞌkahne re, eji ma kang, Eso fꞌfeere re á song ko nsol elehke elkv enye nyi jolo elfuulu ni nde, nde kehm-e tene. Mbang kpeem jol ka-e, nyi ndon agboko, jol eji á jo sꞌseb mbang nyio a abonngo go amahr.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 6:4-8; 10:26-27</char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wahr ebba goji Jisos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Ń ka ba go ewong ji bo kpo lung re Sainai, ji nne bahke ma lak ebo, ji jo lul. Ń ka ba go edi jio ji ejannge nyake no, ji egburu nfeb jo lim, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />ji bo wuku ntang, fere wuk alum. Eji ane bao wuku alum nyao, bo kehm jo gboongo re, Esowo kꞌkpe bung alum nyandiki budu. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Tibre alum nyao gꞌga bo, nya Esowo tongo bo re, “Jol afi nnyam nyi kooro ewong jio, bo bahk-e wulu atal.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Etingitingi, ji ane nyehne no mennge sehng, owo Moses kehm bungu re, “N kpꞌfahle, fere jo kꞌkahm.”<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Wo, wahn ebba go ewong ji bo kpo lung re Sayon, ejahbe ji Esowo bi li go elkpin. Wahn ebba go Jeusalem ji li go ejahbetul Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 4:26</char></note> Wahn ebba goji ellong enjel atahl nku a nku nya ma ba kono go elkak. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Wahn ebba nkon nyi ane ba bo gbo mbang jel bo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jems 1:18</char></note> bo ji bo ma nyon abing ebo go ejahbetul Esowo. Wahn ebba goji Esowo bi li nne no bahke lame ane kpee. Wahn ebba goji atohko nya atingitingi ane ba bo ma lim bo re bo jol go nseenga nseenge.<verse eid="HEB 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Wahn ebba goji Jisos ji li nkonambum no egbanngalung ji nfenfe. Wahn ebba go edi ji bo ma madde alung eme ma kpꞌbungu bada nsol nyi ga nob sehnge ma Ebel.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 11:4</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Jo kunen ekpu, eji ń lꞌkꞌten nne no kpꞌbungu. Eji ane bao ki ma be for ngare nyi bo tene nne no jolo go njini, ye ji jo ko alum Esowo, jo ba rehke bo, anv, wahr bahke foro renan, e lꞌten nne no kpꞌbungu a nahre go ejahbetul Esowo?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 2:1-4</char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Ngare nyio ellum ene gbehke njini. Wo anv, yebnyam re, “Nkpel anyehng nyi nyi ma sa, nyi m bahke gohro gbehke njini, jol njini nyi nyi sang, m bahke tob gbehke elbung fvfo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 21:1</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Á bungu re, “Nkpel anyehng nyi ma sa,” jia kpꞌtibi re, nsol nyi bo limi no bahke gbehke, fere yaange, eji nsol nyi lꞌkꞌma gbehke lꞌsa jol. <verse eid="HEB 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Owo fvfo nobo re wahr kak saam, wahr ji bahke bele ejahbetul ji lꞌkꞌma gbehke. Nong, wahr jo kak Esowo go mbang nyi bahk-e koro,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 4:24</char></note> a ekpunu, a elfahle elfahle. <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />Tibre Esowo ebahre bi li agun nya kpo fi.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s">Elkpin ni kpo kor Esowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Soren asi go elkoro ni abonane ebahne kpo kor-n.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 13:34</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Jo buumen re, li re wahn jo vvrv ajenne. Tibre egom jindiki jia, ji limi ano, fere vvrv babenjel, jol bo kahnem.<verse eid="HEB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Jo buumen ane ba wob go ngbekobo, wahn jol ana ń tob wob ngbekobo a bo, wahn fere jo buumu ane ba bo kpꞌnohko bo, eji ń kpeke li go njini nyia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 12:15</char></note><verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Elbal li ejum ji bahke jo lub ane kpee go mbang anyehng anyehng. Kana lim erehbe! Tibre Esowo bahke lame aneb asꞌsa, a abalimerehbe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 5:5</char></note><verse eid="HEB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Nong, akpohko kꞌjo kor-n! Ji ń lꞌbel, nong, jo gbal-n. Tibre Esowo bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:5">“Wa n nehm yake.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:5">Wa n nehm sennge njahm.”<verse eid="HEB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />E lꞌlim ano, owo e bahke ma bung a esahb esahb re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">“Jehova wo li nkakebo ewame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">n nehm fahl, anv, jen ji nne bahk-m kpe ma lim?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 9:8</char></note><verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Jo buumen atubesi ebahne ba bungu alum Esowo tong-n. Jo tiren bade elkpin ebo, wahn fere jo tir bade ana bo kpo no, fere leeme ekakesehk ebo.<verse eid="HEB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Jisos Kraist jꞌnehm ji jolo nyaane, á li ano lela, á bahke jolo ano ano go njinanjini.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 1:8</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Kana taame, ajoobo ntibi nyindikandiki wer-n tahm a nahne. Tibre nꞌnob re eltim tahn-n tib go nnoobo nyi Esowo, go nsol alehke sang. Tibre ane ba jo toono atahm nya li bada nsol alehke, nnoobo anyehng anyehng joom ka bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 2:16-23</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Abalimajom ba kpo loko go ebkpatahk Esowo, nsahm bo kpimm nyi bo bahke lehke ejum njom ji kun go egahre edi njom alimi. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Tibre enyam bi, ntubesi abalimajom jo ko alung ebo tib abiafem, yel a ma go edi ji kpꞌsahb bꞌbar, bi bi bo jo song jahm bo fi go esi mbang. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Owo wahnge Jisos nyehne erem go esi mbang,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 21:39; 27:31-33</char></note> eji á lꞌko alung mame yefono antahng, ru ane, bo bar go bo abiafem.<verse eid="HEB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Nong, wahr tob lohngen je go ege go esi mbang, tob song bel esono jio jꞌje. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Tibre e kpimm ejahbe go njini nyia, ji bahke jolo ano ano, e kpꞌsebe na ejahbe ji kpꞌbake. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Nong, wahr soren asi, jo lim njom nyio nyi Esowo atehke ngare anyehng anyehng sehng goji Jisos, nyi lohngo re, wahr jo yiimi ntianse nyi mbing enye go egahre anyo. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Kana yini nnoobo alimi, wahn fere jo kak atemtem ebo. Tibre ajom ana nyao nya kpo kor Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 12:1</char></note><verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Jo kaken atubesi ebahne, wahn fere woomo bo go elwo. Tibre bo ba kpꞌbaabe atohko enyahne, eji bo li ane ba Esowo bahke bahbe bo bade ana bo limi no. Ń lꞌlim ano, bo bahke jo lim eltum ebo go eyebatahng. Tohko jol ano, bo bahke jo lim eltum ebo a aromo go nnyo. Nyaa, nnoobo anyehng anyehng wahn nehm ka.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Jo kaken ero tv-r! Tibre e kpꞌkahne re, ntim enyahre li saang, eji e kpꞌsebe re wahr lim ji kpꞌnobo ngare anyehng anyehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Kor 8:21</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />N kp-n sahb gbꞌgboongo re wahn jo lim ano, eji Esowo lꞌgulu elfeere a name ba ka-n.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esꞌkohro nnyo akake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Nong, Esowo elkoono bi nyahme Ntul a Jisos go elkv, ji li egburu mbaabebul tib go alung ma egbanngalung ji li go njinanjini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 10:11; 1 Pit 2:25</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />ka-n ejum ajehng ajehng ji kpꞌnobo, eji ń lꞌmal jo lim mbang enye, á fere lim eltum go egahne atahng, toono o, ń lim ji kp-e koro sehng goji Jisos Kraist.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 2:13</char></note> Nong, ellub jol ka-e go njinanjini. Emen.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Abonanee, n kp-n gboongo re, wahn lub wuk erehke jia, tibre n nyono mmonkpehrekahba mmonwer tv-n. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />N kpꞌsebe re wahn kahn re, mmonanne ewahre Timoti, bo m-e yehke go ngbekobo. Á lꞌgulu elbake, m bahk-e koko ba a ne, n lꞌba, ba nyehn-n.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Kaken atubesi ebahne kpee nnyo, a aneb Esowo kpee, a abonane ebahre ba li go Itali kp-n tob kak nnyo.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Nong, nnoobo nyi Esowo jol a nahne, wahn ane kpee. Emen.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>